OL,3,AMeghan makes first official public
OL,4,Aappearance since moving back to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex has made her
OL,7,Ffirst official public appearance since
OL,8,Fmoving back to the UK, telling
OL,9,Fwell-wishers "it's great to be back".
OL,11,FMeghan arrived at a youth charity in
OL,12,FNottingham alongside her husband, the
OL,13,FDuke of Sussex, on Thursday morning.
OL,14,FThe pair, who are also expected to
OL,15,Fvisit a food bank later, hugged and
OL,16,Fposed for selfies with the public.
OL,18,FThe duchess spoke to a number of people
OL,19,Fin the crowd, telling one "we got
OL,20,Flucky" as they chatted about the
OL,21,Fweather.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
